# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# data — keep synthesized JSON (needed at build time), ignore raw/CSV/progress/logs
**/data/outscraper-plumbers.csv
**/data/raw/.scrape-progress.json
**/data/raw/plumbers-with-synthesis.json
# Intermediate scoring batches consumed by apply-manual-synthesis.js — written
# by build-resynth-inputs.js + parallel Claude subagents, then ingested into
# Firestore. Scratch files; the source of truth is Firestore.
**/data/raw/synth-input-*.json
**/data/raw/synth-batch-*.json
**/data/raw/resynth-input-*.json
**/data/synthesized/.synthesis-progress.json
**/data/logs/
# Local synthesis paste-flow scratch (synth-local.js). Firestore is truth.
**/data/synth-tasks.json
**/data/synth-results.json
# Synth-pipeline runs (scripts/synth/). Per-run dir; Firestore is truth.
**/data/synth-runs/

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
**/coverage

# next.js
/.next/
**/out/

# production
**/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files and secrets
.env*
service-account.json

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# monorepo
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
.turbo

# Secrets — never commit
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_rsa.pub
service-account*.json
credentials*.json
gcp-*.json
firebase-adminsdk-*.json

# Claude Code session-local state — never commit
.claude/

# Synth pipeline intermediate stderr/stdout logs from generate-batches.js
apps/plumbers-web/generate*.log
apps/plumbers-web/generate*.stdout.log
apps/plumbers-web/generate*.stderr.log
